  "details": "Unsure how to replicate as it happened randomly but I can describe it.. Hello, I am having a weird glitch on the game. I am unable to speak; the audio for some reason doesn't register on the microphone or Mic Activation threshold. However, it does work if I am recording on my Oculus device and am in the game. (To clarify, my mic ONLY works in VRChat if I'm using the Oculus recording software.) It's not a problem with the mic or Oculus itself, I think, as I can talk normally on other applications/Oculus calls. But for some reason, not in VRChat, and I have found no supporting info to help.\n\nAlso, I have factory reset the device, uninstalled and reinstalled VRChat multiple times, and messed with the permissions in every combination. (Also, the Oculus settings show that the permissions are connecting to the app in the logs, so it's not that either.)\n\nSome help would be appreciated :)",
